      "content": "it's more than just being tired or needing rest. it's like i've seen things that make all this \"normal life\" stuff look like a joke. there's a part of me that feels like i've already left. like there's no point in trying to bridge the gap between who i was and this... this hollow version of a person everyone expects me to be. does that even make sense? like, am i even supposed to be here?",
